  "summary": "5 features across HagiCode-org/hagicode-core, HagiCode-org/web.",
  "bodyHtml": "<h2 id=\"features\">Features</h2>\n<h3 id=\"hagicode-orghagicode-core\">HagiCode-org/hagicode-core</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>adventures:</strong> add English locale Chinese text detection and improve translations (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/3e836d7ef0636135f404cc7d1aee1bd61e22ddc6\"><code>3e836d7</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>vault:</strong> add local file cleanup option to vault deletion (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/f44bd91f88e50bfd6902bdb3adb559ddce293309\"><code>f44bd91</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>sessions:</strong> add session export service with JSON and Markdown formats (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/hagicode-core/commit/d61114be592524170588fd81a3fbbf0081ddc6c0\"><code>d61114b</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"hagicode-orgweb\">HagiCode-org/web</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>tier-rating:</strong> add tier rating image library (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/671bbf20b1599cf30581344ba5101d3412ed2938\"><code>671bbf2</code></a>)</li>\n<li><strong>tour:</strong> add driver.js tour infrastructure (<a href=\"https://github.com/HagiCode-org/web/commit/a15ccc612a3e47286bb227f7e0be223cdb1e61e8\"><code>a15ccc6</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>",
